  "version": "0.5.0",
  "notes": "### Added\n- Arrange the four Money sections by dragging or from Customize layout. The order follows your workspace across devices and works on phones too.\n- Delete or archive goals and savings accounts directly from their cards, without opening Edit.\n- Settings now group every option into six searchable categories, with a desktop sub-navigation and a phone category list with short descriptions.\n- Version history loads older versions and deleted files in pages instead of displaying everything at once. Day labels stay visible while scrolling, and small files show their size in bytes.\n- Install and configure Pyxida from a terminal without opening the app, with checksummed downloads and automatic agent connections.\n- Start Pyxida at login without a window. The tray menu can open it, sync now or quit; closing the window keeps it running when background startup is enabled.\n- Today starts with the five most urgent overdue deadlines and their days late. Show all expands the list without hiding the rest of your day.\n- Tasks due today or tomorrow have clear orange labels. Overdue tasks appear in a quiet, flat list with their parent path; reschedule one from its menu, complete it with its checkbox, or reschedule all with confirmation when there are many and an Undo option.\n- Today and the app icon show the number of overdue tasks.\n- Optional morning notifications summarize overdue and upcoming deadlines at a chosen local time. Preferences travel with the workspace.",
